<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs steady/off $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs steady/off $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were steady to $0.50 lower. Demand and supplies unevenly light to moderate. Trading activity slow. Top $59.00 per cwt. - USDA US 1-2 230-260 lbs.  57.00-58.00, few 58.50-59.00</p>
<p>US 2-3 230-260 lbs.  55.50-57.00</p>
<p>Sows: Steady to firm. Top 55.00</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-400 lbs. 45.00-49.50, mostly 47.00-49.00</p>
<p>	  400-500 lbs. 48.00-51.00</p>
<p>	  500-600 lbs. 50.00-54.00</p>
<p>  few over  600 lbs. 52.00-55.00</p>
</text>
